{"ID":"20240118151052-2cjgc5h","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151052-2cjgc5h","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151052-2cjgc5h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151052-xkd2mrl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122141804-rmktiwg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122141804-rmktiwg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:78,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:78\u0026#125;","title":"246蟅虫（地鳖虫）","type":"doc","updated":"20240202101142"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151052-xkd2mrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151052-xkd2mrl","updated":"20240122141720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，寒，有毒。治心腹寒热洒洒，血积，症瘕，破坚，下血闭，生子大良。生川泽及沙中、人家墙壁下土中湿处。一名地鳖。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141722-01blww9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141722-01blww9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，多生墙壁下土中湿处，形扁小，六足，似鳖而无甲。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141724-wkr52mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141724-wkr52mk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141725-4bh8dvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141725-4bh8dvx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蟅虫为破症瘕下血积要药，主心腹寒热，留血积聚，治乳脉不通，妇人经闭，产后血积，折伤瘀血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141729-rzdu5ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141729-rzdu5ws"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【药征】主治干血，故兼治少腹满痛，及妇人经水不利。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141731-v9hnqrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141731-v9hnqrf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141732-gubpv5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141732-gubpv5k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】用皂荚菖蒲，无瘀血停留者忌，孕妇慎用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141733-65nv933","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141733-65nv933"}},{"ID":"20240122141733-rd0rg0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141733-rd0rg0m"}},{"ID":"20240122141733-kmkbmt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141733-kmkbmt1","updated":"20240202100918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二百四十六，蟅虫，大家看，这是蟅虫。拿起没关系，已经烤焦了。不会跑出来咬你的。蟅虫呢，我们叫地鳖虫。你如果乡下老灶，那个锅子，你那个铁锅子一打开来，当然里面有伏龙肝，就是我们灶心土。你还会看到里面有大蜈蚣，蜈蚣很喜欢躲在里面，地鳖虫在里面，地鳖虫跑出来，六只脚，那个背后一条一条的，地鳖虫。就是这里讲的蟅虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141745-zg1h2ql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141745-zg1h2ql","updated":"20240202100946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们前面跟大家讲大黄蟅虫丸里面的蟅虫。这个246呢，这个蟅虫。这个245我们讲蜚蠊。这个蜚蠊就是蟑螂。蟅虫又名地鳖虫，它的味咸有毒，那一般来说，活血化瘀，尤其是攻妇女的，子宫里面瘀血的时候都会使用。那为什么说下血闭，生子大良。就是说你如果一个妇女子宫里面完全没有瘀血，因为你的组织非常的健康嘛，当然会生小孩，生的很正常，对不对。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141751-edtrtop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141751-edtrtop","updated":"20240202101003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这到处都有，味咸的，咸味的统统可以软坚。那你如果使用，你说“老师，子宫里面有硬块呀，肿瘤呀，有那个肌瘤呀或什么，脂肪瘤”，没有关系。都可以使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141800-o3bd5ge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141800-o3bd5ge","updated":"20240202101125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那蟅虫呢，是破症瘕下血积要药，有时候我们血瘀在里面排不出来，我前面讲过，会让人发狂的，我们可以用蟅虫，像留血积聚，乳脉不通，妇人经闭，因为女人的月经跟奶水是相通的。那【药征】，主治干血，这个干血，我们有个特别名称叫做痨证，干血痨。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个血干在里面，清出来不好清，太久了，陈血，陈年的血，会让一个人非常的疲劳，我们叫干血痨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。工作一下就会很疲劳，痨证。那我们要用些昆虫甲虫类的药来清它。我讲干血你怎么知道呀，很简单，小腿的地方肌肤甲错，那是主要的症状。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141804-rmktiwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141804-rmktiwg","updated":"20240202101142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看这个虻虫呢，你如果开的时候，虻虫是一钱两钱就够了，就很强了，不用开太多。这个蟅虫呢，你可以开几只，比如一钱两钱，或者十只都没有关系，你开几只就可以。"}]}]}